The '''Weather Station''' is a [[Location]] at the top of the {{Zone|Mountain}} on the [[Hub Island]]. It is home to {{NPCSprite|Professor Wynd}}, who explains [[Weather]] mechanics, as well as his pet {{NPCSprite|Sunny}}.

{{ZoneText|Learn about &bWeather &ffrom Professor Wynd.|Pet the &eCat&f.}}

== Purpose ==
The '''Weather Station''' contains {{NPCSprite|Professor Wynd}}, who explains the [[Weather]] mechanic.

