== Trivia ==
* Before being called the '''Weather Station''', this house used to contain {{NPCSprite|Scoop}}. However, he has since been moved to a different part of the {{Zone|Mountain}}.
* While there are two {{Item|Fairy Soul}}s very close to the '''Weather Station''', they are still within the {{Zone|Mountain}} zone.

